CHANGES
=======

2026.10.08
----------
* Add support for psycopg v3 as an alternative Postgres driver, selected
  with the `driver` argument to PostgresContainerFixture or the
  DBTESTTOOLS_PG_DRIVER environment variable
* BREAKING: Require SQLAlchemy 2.0 or later and remove support for the
  legacy (v1) API. SessionFixture sessions are now always bound to the test's
  Connection rather than the Engine, which was previously the default
  (`future=False`). Code that expects `session.bind` or `session.get_bind()`
  to be an Engine should use `session.get_bind().engine` instead
* The `future` argument to DatabaseResource, SessionFixture,
  SqliteMemoryFixture and PostgresContainerFixture is deprecated and ignored;
  passing it emits a DeprecationWarning
* BREAKING: Drop support for Python 3.8 and 3.9, and add Python 3.14
* Stop leaking the Postgres container if PostgresContainerFixture fails to
  set up after starting it

2024.11.11
----------
* Add expire_on_commit option to sessions

2024.07.21
----------
* Use Hatch to test and build the project
* Replace Black with Ruff for formatting and checking
* Allow overriding of the PG server IP address

2023.01.27
----------

* Improve uniqueness of PostgreSQL container names
* Very important readme typo changes
* Update Black to 22.0.3 to fix build

2021.10.27
----------

* Add Changelog
* Prepare for a public release
* First release
